"description":"MEOW... there’s nothing quite like a kitty’s love… especially when your kitty is the most adorable and fluffy kitty in all of Kitty Land! Rumor has it she's totally in love with you too! \nYour new kitty needs lots of love and attention to help her flourish and grow up! Care for your new fluffy friend and make her the happiest kitty in Kitty Land!\n\n* Choose your dream pet from 6 adorable kitties!\n* Feed your hungry kitty with tons delicious snacks!\n* Bathe your kitty 'till she's sparkling and clean!\n* Treat your injured kitty with special vet tools!\n* Play sweet and fun-filled games with your adorable kitty!\n* Dress up your kitty in a variety of stylish outfits and cute accessories!\n* Race with your kitty! How fast can your kitty run?!  \n* Photo booth fun! Take a picture with your new dream pet!\n* Enjoy adorable and interactive 3D animations!", "userRatingCount":3432}, 
